# DevFlow Core

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../../AGENTS.md). When CodeBuddy supports skills, load `skills/devflow-core/SKILL.md` and its shared methods source; Core then loads only the selected lifecycle reference. Without skills, use the portable fallback in `AGENTS.md`.

Preserve Core-exclusive routing, explicit STOP gates, selective memory recall, direct independent-review routes, and Prove before completion. For creative work — creating features, building components, adding functionality, modifying behavior, or defining an unapproved problem-directed change — Core selects `devflow-brainstorm` before implementation; pure inquiry, verification, investigation-only, and approved changes are exceptions. This adapter does not restate skill internals.
